{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 29, :comments ["<b>And he made the anointing oil.</b> Our rabbis of blessed memory: why was this passage fixed here, since with it he is destined to anoint all the utensils of the Tabernacle, and the work of the altar of burnt offering and the laver and the rest of the utensils has not yet been completed?" "<b>Incense of spices, pure.</b> That it requires purity, as it is written: ״זבובי מות יבאיש יביע שמן רוקח״."], :book :exodus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 37, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:02:07.533113351Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}